    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9173" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cōlōtes</span></b> , ae,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κωλωτής</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
